---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="404">
  <section class="nf mono">
    <p class="muted">$ curl -I {'<this page>'}</p>
    <p class="code">HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found</p>
    <p>这个页面不存在，或者已经被移走了。</p>
    <p><a href="/">← 回到首页</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .code {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
